{"text": "3. Subtract the result of step 2 from the result of step 1: 120 - 17 = 103 - 79 = 24.", "start": 306, "end": 391, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Another solution:", "start": 393, "end": 410, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 + 12) × (10 - 7) = 22 × 3 = 66 - 42 = 24", "start": 411, "end": 455, "label": "inform"}
