{"text": "So, one correct expression is:", "start": 606, "end": 636, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(10 + 12) × (10 - 7) = 24", "start": 637, "end": 662, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Therefore, the final answer is:", "start": 664, "end": 695, "label": "inform"}
